---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Preview from '../components/Preview.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import ConnectionPair from '../components/ConnectionPair.astro';
import {subjects,byId} from '../data/catalog';
import {url} from '../lib/urls';
const path='/';
---
<Layout title="A graphics workshop" path={path}>
  <section class="hero workshop-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">A personal playground</span><h1>A graphics<br/> workshop.</h1><p class="intro">Rendering and simulation experiments, built with coding agents. I follow what catches my interest and build on what I learn.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/demos/',path)}>Explore the demos ↗</a></div><div class="hero-media"><Preview entry="ocean-surface" title="Ocean" path={path} eager hover={false}/><div class="media-caption"><a href={url('/demos/ocean/',path)}>Ocean · explore the scene ↗</a><span>Waves, foam and changing light</span></div></div></section>
  <nav class="subject-strip" aria-label="Explore subjects">{subjects.map(f=><a href={url(`/demos/${f.id}/`,path)}>{f.title}</a>)}</nav>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>Things in motion.</h2><a href={url('/demos/simulation/',path)}>All simulation demos ↗</a></div><div class="grid cards">{['water-3d','fire-3d','smoke-2d'].map(id=><Card entry={byId[id]} path={path}/>)}</div><p class="note">Also explore <a href={url('/demos/simulation/explosion-3d/',path)}>Explosion 3D</a>, <a href={url('/demos/simulation/water-2d/',path)}>Water 2D</a> and <a href={url('/demos/simulation/shallow-water/',path)}>shallow water</a>.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>Surface and solid.</h2><a href={url('/demos/materials/#material-library',path)}>All twelve materials · both renderers ↗</a></div><div class="surface-grid"><Card entry={byId['sdf-materials']} path={path}/><Card entry={byId.guardian} path={path}/></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="connections"><div class="section-head"><h2>One experiment opens another.</h2><p>Useful pieces find their way into other scenes.</p></div><div class="grid two connections-grid"><ConnectionPair id="water-to-terrain" from="shallow-water" to="terrain-water" path={path}/><ConnectionPair id="sky-to-materials" from="atmosphere-light" to="mesh-materials" path={path}/></div></section>
  <section class="section about"><h2>Following the next idea.</h2><div><p>Cubey started with reviving an old engine and getting back to graphics experiments. Working with coding agents has let me explore further, while the projects and their shared foundation grow together.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/about/',path)}>About the workshop ↗</a></div></section>
</Layout>
